---
<svg class:list={["icon", cls]} width={size} height={size} viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d={paths[name]} /></svg>
